+# MLOps Architect Handbook
+
+## Purpose
+
+This maintained handbook provides research-backed architecture guidance for Senior, Staff, and Principal MLOps and ML Platform Architects.
+
+## Scope and reading guidance
+
+The initial milestone establishes the publishing framework and reserves Chapter 1 for **MLOps Architecture Foundations: From ML Lifecycle to Enterprise Platform Strategy**. Raw source material in [`../vol1.md`](../vol1.md) remains append-only and outside this handbook's editing scope.
+
+## Publication status
+
+- Handbook state: Scaffold
+- Chapter 1 state: Planned
+- Publication state: Not publication ready
+
+## Handbook map
+
+- [Editorial status](EDITORIAL_STATUS.md)
+- [Style guide](STYLE_GUIDE.md)
+- [Glossary](GLOSSARY.md)
+- [References](sources/references.md)
+- [Claim ledger](sources/claim-ledger.csv)
+- [Chapter 1 diagrams](diagrams/chapter-01/README.md)
+
+## Contribution workflow
+
+Work from a frozen, recorded source observation when extraction is required. Add claim-level evidence before advancing a chapter, maintain editable text diagrams, run local validation, and obtain independent technical and editorial review before publication-ready status.
+
+## Changelog
+
+### 2026-08-23
+
+- Created the handbook scaffold and documented its publication contract.
